entries[448473] = { ["name"] = "Reaper's Mark", ["text"] = "Blood\nDancing Rune Weapon empowers your next Marrowrend to become Reaper's Mark.\n\nReaper's Mark\nViciously slice into the soul of your enemy, dealing (146.25% of Attack Power) Shadowfrost damage and applying Reaper's Mark.\n\nEach time you deal Shadow or Frost damage, add a stack of Reaper's Mark. After 12 sec or reaching 40 stacks, the mark explodes, dealing (17.9934% of Attack Power) damage per stack.\n\nReaper's Mark travels to an unmarked enemy nearby if the target dies.\n\nUnholy\nPillar of Frost empowers your next Obliterate to become Reaper's Mark.\n\nReaper's Mark\nViciously slice into the soul of your enemy, dealing (249.6% of Attack Power) Shadowfrost damage and applying Reaper's Mark.\n\nEach time you deal Shadow or Frost damage, add a stack of Reaper's Mark. After 12 sec or reaching 40 stacks, the mark explodes, dealing (32.3882% of Attack Power) damage per stack.\n\nReaper's Mark travels to an unmarked enemy nearby if the target dies.\n\nFrost\nPillar of Frost empowers your next Obliterate to become Reaper's Mark.\n\nReaper's Mark\nViciously slice into the soul of your enemy, dealing (249.6% of Attack Power) Shadowfrost damage and applying Reaper's Mark.\n\nEach time you deal Shadow or Frost damage, add a stack of Reaper's Mark. After 12 sec or reaching 40 stacks, the mark explodes, dealing (32.3882% of Attack Power) damage per stack.\n\nReaper's Mark travels to an unmarked enemy nearby if the target dies. Does not benefit from Killing Machine" }
